description:
Model and reality TV icon Olandria is ready to dish all her unfiltered opinions in this deep dive into her Watch History. She takes us back to the vault with the most controversial music video of her career, unexpected side quests, and the biggest red flags in the dating scene.

From hot pepper challenges to cooking in nature and her all-time favorite fan edits, Olandria is eating it up! She talks launching her own channel, her favorite creators (shoutout Quenlin Blackwell!), and the latest on Nicolandria. Tune in for the best of #olandriacore. 

